  "title": "Chicken Tikka Masala",
  "description": "Chicken tikka masala made easy with this delicious recipe. Marinate chicken in yogurt and spices, grill, then simmer together in a tomato cream sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Yakuta"
  ],
